<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins $2.00-3.00 higher; butts mostly 5.00 higher; skinned hams 1.00-2.00 higher; seedless bellies 2.00-4.00 higher; lean trimmings 2.00-3.00 higher.</p>
<p>Trading moderate, with mostly moderate demand and light offerings. - USDA</p>
